From 301b24e5e3dcbf66e6a6ec7f1e591c08d1fffc04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Felix=20F=C3=B6rtsch?= <mail@felixfoertsch.de>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:49:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add channel-title filtering

Add an admin-only auto-ignore regular-expression filter to channel
settings. Validate and persist channel-specific patterns and reload them
before each queued download. Move matching videos to ignored without
failing the queue or changing archived videos.

Include the channel editor and regression tests for matching, validation,
isolation, persistence, settings reloads and queue continuation.
